            <div class="asset-hub-title">Agents</div><div class="asset-hub-desc">Informasi agent, vendor, produsen, dan pihak terkait asset.</div><div class="asset-hub-badge">Segera dikembangkan</div>
        </a>

        <a class="asset-hub-card is-disabled" href="#" aria-disabled="true" onclick="return false;">
